    {
      "stableId": "math2-2011-q02",
      "sourceYear": 2011,
      "subjectCode": "math2",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "questionNumber": 2,
      "stem": "已知 f (x ) 在 x = 0 处可导，且 $f ( 0 ) = 0$ ，则 $\\operatorname* { l i m } _ { x \\to 0 } { \\frac { x ^ { 2 } f ( x ) - 2 f \\left( x ^ { 3 } \\right) } { x ^ { 3 } } } =$",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "value": "$- 2 f ^ { \\prime } ( 0 ) .$"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "value": "$- f ^ { \\prime } ( 0 )$"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "value": "$f ^ { \\prime } ( 0 )$"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "value": "0．"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应选(B)．由导数的定义可得\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {x ^ {2} f (x) - 2 f (x ^ {3})}{x ^ {3}} = \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {x ^ {2} f (x) - x ^ {2} f (0) - 2 f (x ^ {3}) + 2 f (0)}{x ^ {3}} \\\\ = \\lim _ {x \\to 0} \\left[ \\frac {f (x) - f (0)}{x} - 2 \\frac {f \\left(x ^ {3}\\right) - f (0)}{x ^ {3}} \\right] \\\\ = f ^ {\\prime} (0) - 2 f ^ {\\prime} (0) = - f ^ {\\prime} (0). \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "reviewStatus": "needs_human_review",
      "finalizationStatus": "blocked",
      "knowledgePoints": [],
      "anomalies": [],
      "sourceEvidence": [
