    {
      "stableId": "math2-2011-q03",
      "sourceYear": 2011,
      "subjectCode": "math2",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "questionNumber": 3,
      "stem": "函数 $f ( x ) { = } \\ln | ( x - 1 ) ( x - 2 ) ( x - 3 ) |$ 的驻点个数为· · ·",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "value": "0．"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "value": "2．"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "value": "3．"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应选 (C)．由 $f ( x ) = \\ln | x - 1 | + \\ln | x - 2 | + \\ln | x - 3 |$ 得\n\n$$\nf ^ {\\prime} (x) = \\frac {1}{x - 1} + \\frac {1}{x - 2} + \\frac {1}{x - 3} = \\frac {3 x ^ {2} - 1 2 x + 1 1}{(x - 1) (x - 2) (x - 3)}.\n$$\n\n令 $f ^ { \\prime } ( x ) = 0$ ，得 $x _ { 1 , 2 } = { \\frac { 6 \\pm { \\sqrt { 3 } } } { 3 } }$ ， 故 f (x)有两个不同的驻点",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "reviewStatus": "needs_human_review",
      "finalizationStatus": "blocked",
      "knowledgePoints": [],
      "anomalies": [],
      "sourceEvidence": [
