    {
      "stableId": "math2-2011-q20",
      "sourceYear": 2011,
      "subjectCode": "math2",
      "type": "solution",
      "questionNumber": 20,
      "stem": "（本题满分11分）\n\n一容器的内侧是由图中曲线绕 y 轴旋转一周而成的曲面，该曲线由 $x ^ { 2 } + y ^ { 2 } = 2 y$ $( y \\geqslant \\frac 1 2 )$ ）与 $x ^ { 2 } + y ^ { 2 } = 1 ( y \\leqslant \\frac { 1 } { 2 } )$ ）连接而成．\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-06-13/e449599b-2700-4385-854a-dadd4cdb0815/db6c1904899f4ef491d184d1d94471b573b7eceea893455393c6cfcbf1a8275e.jpg)\n\n\n(Ⅰ)求容器的容积；\n\n(Ⅱ) 若将容器内盛满的水从容器顶部全部抽出，至少需要做多少功？\n\n（长度单位：m，重力加速度为 $g \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }$ ，水的密度为 $1 0 ^ { 3 } \\mathrm { k g / m ^ { 3 } }$ ．）",
      "options": [],
      "answer": null,
      "answerStatus": "missing",
      "explanation": "解. (Ⅰ)由对称性，所求的容积为\n\n$$\nV = V _ {1} + V _ {2} = 2 \\int_ {- 1} ^ {\\frac {1}{2}} \\pi x ^ {2} d y = 2 \\pi \\int_ {- 1} ^ {\\frac {1}{2}} (1 - y ^ {2}) d y = \\frac {9}{4} \\pi .\n$$\n\n(Ⅱ)所做的功为\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} W = \\pi \\rho g \\int_ {- 1} ^ {\\frac {1}{2}} (2 - y) (1 - y ^ {2}) d y + \\pi \\rho g \\int_ {\\frac {1}{2}} ^ {2} (2 - y) (2 y - y ^ {2}) d y \\\\ = \\pi \\rho g \\left(\\int_ {- 1} ^ {\\frac {1}{2}} \\left(y ^ {3} - 2 y ^ {2} - y + 2\\right) d y + \\int_ {\\frac {1}{2}} ^ {2} \\left(y ^ {3} - 4 y ^ {2} + 4 y\\right) d y\\right) \\\\ = \\frac {2 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {3}}{8} \\pi g = 3 3 7 5 g \\pi . \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$",
